  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Mia_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Mia
    text: I'm leaving the unit offline for seven days. The company will send someone
      twice a week during the observation period.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 304cf24d016249a4bbf5abcf6c40f609, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Laura_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: What? Why can't you just turn it back on?
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d080a632bb3492c41b74adfcad1b46ec, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Laura_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Seven days? So who's supposed to be there for Ava?
    holdSeconds: 4.923585
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6af71e420a1bf34296fdd454a2ded62, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Mia_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: "It's a permitted option. It gives you and Mark a chance to talk to Ava
      directly\u2014without the unit in the middle."
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8abec48ba188c6e4f9d6159678ad9c4c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Laura_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: When? We can barely keep our heads above water as it is. That's the whole
      point of the unit.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03bf59f6f19e06b419abecbffa36f300, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplay_B_Mark_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mark
    text: Laura. Come on. She's doing her job.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5718a8a89a4da6c4e818e9e6d004768b, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
